post.description:
The mail (in the language of `Accept-Language`) carries a token valid 24 hours;
confirm it with `POST /api/v1/auth/email-verification/confirm`. At most one mail
per minute per address.

delete.description:
Signed in with a password session only. Its refresh token stops working at once;
an access token already issued to it keeps working until it expires (15 minutes by
default).

get.description:
No sign-in (the tenant comes from the domain). Moderation may hide content of consumers only
for these reasons (legal rule `moderation.hide_reasons`; Consumer Protection Law 19/2023/QH15,
Decree 55/2024/ND-CP): a negative but lawful review stays visible.

parameters.description:
Only tenants whose subscription is in this state: `trialing`, `active`, `past_due`,
`suspended`, `canceled` or `deleted`. Subscriptions come with the plans module (step 35);
without it no tenant has one, so the page is empty.

